{"ID":"20240719165556-zpkeo4g","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240719165556-zpkeo4g","title":"穿心草","type":"doc","updated":"20240902143657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240719165958-mqijz12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240719165958-mqijz12","updated":"20240719165958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 350px;","style":"width: 340px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草 2-20240719165958-zdmp9p5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 340px;\" parent-style=\"width: 350px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240719170626-45s6rzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240719170626-45s6rzr","updated":"20240719170917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 661px;","style":"width: 651px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草 8-20240719170917-gof2qzf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 651px;\" parent-style=\"width: 661px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 516px;","style":"width: 506px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草 7-20240719170603-7f8rjyc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 506px;\" parent-style=\"width: 516px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240719170920-474w7it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240719170920-474w7it","updated":"20240719170920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草 3-20240719170046-ne4pcmb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心莲"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心莲-20240719165302-dku8q7s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240719170119-dg5z644","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240719170119-dg5z644","updated":"20240719171340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 282px;","style":"width: 272px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草 5-20240719170209-p4kaum4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 272px;\" parent-style=\"width: 282px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 795px;","style":"width: 785px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草 9-20240719171340-54xgmkc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 785px;\" parent-style=\"width: 795px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240719171358-yxvgk1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240719171358-yxvgk1c","updated":"20240719171358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 590px;","style":"width: 580px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草-20240719165819-ovv1g1p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 580px;\" parent-style=\"width: 590px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 655px;","style":"width: 645px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草 1-20240719165900-fyek7f9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 645px;\" parent-style=\"width: 655px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240719171339-5dncguf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240719171339-5dncguf","updated":"20240719171339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 573px;","style":"width: 563px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心草 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心草 4-20240719170119-zc4n2ns.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 563px;\" parent-style=\"width: 573px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 417px;","style":"width: 407px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"穿心莲 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/穿心莲 1-20240719165452-557at9l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 407px;\" parent-style=\"width: 417px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240719165820-0en1wz4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240719165820-0en1wz4"}},{"ID":"20240902143650-6oak9pm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-6oak9pm","updated":"20240902143657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：穿心草"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-qbx6gpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-qbx6gpm","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穿心草《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-d1z9b9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-d1z9b9v","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChuānXīnCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-o586jj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-o586jj6","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】串钱草、穿钱草、顶心风"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-e6eqk3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-e6eqk3n","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】龙胆科穿心草属植物穿心草Canscoralucidissimma（Levl.etVant.）Hand.-Mazz.的全草。秋冬采收，去杂质，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-xksdrr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-xksdrr4","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】微甘、微苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-m5x13jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-m5x13jz","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热解毒，止咳，止痛。用于肺热咳嗽，胃痛，黄疸型肝炎，毒蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-fb7kqq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-fb7kqq7","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～5钱；毒蛇咬伤用量加倍。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-k81e4by","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-k81e4by","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-adrnwh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-adrnwh3","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穿心草《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-rfuea5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-rfuea5r","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《广西中草药》"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-jnfbpgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-jnfbpgo","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChuānXīnCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-cz7xryr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-cz7xryr","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】穿钱草、顶心风（《广西中草药》），穿心莲、狮子草（《广西实用中草药新选》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-0pyn8ut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-0pyn8ut","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为龙胆科植物穿心草的全草。秋、冬采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-k3etdl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-k3etdl3","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】一年生直立分枝草本，全体无毛，茎圆柱形，淡黄绿色，二叉状分枝。叶对生；基部合生而略成圆形，茎贯穿其中心，全缘，纸质，上面绿色，下面粉绿色，叶脉约14条，基部呈放射状，顶端略弯曲，两面均凸出，网脉明显；无柄。具叶的聚伞花序顶生；花两性，白色，无柄，为一漏斗形的叶所包围；花冠管圆柱形，膜质，约与萼管等长，通常5裂，裂片倒卵形；雄蕊通常5，生于花冠管上，与花冠裂片互生。蒴果长卵形，果皮膜质，为高约8毫米的漏斗形的叶所包。种子极细小，多数，扁圆形，棕黄色。花期秋、冬季。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-uhpdyef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-uhpdyef","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于石山或土山坡的岩石缝中。半阴生。分布广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-jjog0sg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-jjog0sg","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】印度产的同属植物Canscoradecussata中含某种结晶性成分，有拟胆碱样作用：降低麻醉犬血压，对离体兔心及蛙心有抑制作用，兴奋小肠、子宫、支气管平滑肌，并能增强乙酰胆碱对蛙腹直肌的收缩。另一种成分则仅有某些中枢镇静作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-yf5lm9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-yf5lm9t","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-hlfr2n1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-hlfr2n1","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《广西中草药》：\"味微甘微苦，性平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-c5hqeno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-c5hqeno","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《广西实用中草药新选》：\"味微苦，性凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-rp3ipqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-rp3ipqx","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-rohcewc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-rohcewc","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清热解毒，活血止痛。治肺热咳嗽，肝炎，钩端螺旋体病，黄疸，胸痛，胃痛，跌打内瘀，毒蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-qrltd8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-qrltd8y","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《广西中草药》：\"理气，止痛，止咳。治肺热咳嗽，心胃气痛，毒蛇咬伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-tqjfs88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-tqjfs88","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《广西实用中草药新选》：\"凉肝胆，活血止痛。治黄疸，肝炎，胸痛，胃痛，跌打内伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-4fwd7lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-4fwd7lb","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③广州空军《常用中草药手册》：\"治急性支气管炎，肺炎，急性胃炎，十二指肠炎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-q8ql06j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-q8ql06j","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3～5钱，治毒蛇咬伤用量加倍。外用：煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-cmm894x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-cmm894x","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-jj8vw2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-jj8vw2c","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治肺热咳嗽：穿心草三钱，干红薯叶三钱。水煎服。（《广西中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-o5s4m6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-o5s4m6k","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治钩端螺旋体病：金猫头、岩泽兰、穿心草、岩松（均鲜草）各一钱半。水煎，分三次服，喉痛者加野花椒全株一两半；鼻出血者，用酢浆草捣烂冲服。外用榄茶树叶、香椿树叶、香椿树皮、臭茉莉叶、追山虎叶、酸汤秆全草各一斤煎汤，每天洗两次。（《全展选编·传染病》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-tgk6cjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-tgk6cjx","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-wwrlyc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-wwrlyc7","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穿心草《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-ydihvab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-ydihvab","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《广西中草药》"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-fdua0td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-fdua0td","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChuānXīnCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-oryk4jf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-oryk4jf","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】穿钱草、顶心风、狮子草、穿心莲"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-wpd63b4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-wpd63b4","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-c1sc678","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-c1sc678","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为龙胆科植物穿心草的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-zvc71mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-zvc71mp","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Canscoralucidissima（Levl.etVant.）Hand．－Mazz．[EuphorbialucidissimaLevl．EtVant．；Euphor-biopsislucidissima（Levl．EtVant．）Levl．」"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-n9enqsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-n9enqsg","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋、冬季采收，洗净，鲜用或扎把晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-vrfvxnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-vrfvxnk","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】一年生草本，高10-30cm。全株光滑无毛。茎直立，黄绿色，多分枝，枝柔弱。基生叶对生，具短柄，叶片卵形；上中部空叶为穿茎叶，叶片圆形，直径7-20mm，上面绿色，下面灰绿色；具突出的网状脉。聚伞花序呈假二叉状分枝，具多花，苞片叶状；花萼钟形，长5-6mm，萼筒膜质，5小齿，不等长；花白色或淡黄色。钟形，长6-8mm，长圆状匙形；雄蕊5，着生于花冠筒上部，与裂片互生，花药不完全发育；子房无柄，长圆形，花柱丝状，柱头小，头状。蒴果内藏，宽长圆形，长4-5mm。种子多数，扁平，黄褐色，表面具网纹。花、果期8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-d3cozhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-d3cozhc","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-ogzyyuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-ogzyyuk","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于石灰岩山坡较阴湿的岩壁或石缝中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-1rv3chy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-1rv3chy","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于广西、贵州等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-ucw1kle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-ucw1kle","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】印度产的同属植物Canscoradecussata中含某种结晶性成分，有拟胆碱样作用：降低麻醉犬血压，对离体兔心及蛙心有抑制作用，兴奋小肠、子宫、支气管平滑肌，并能增强乙酰胆碱对蛙腹直肌的收。另一种成分则仅有某些中枢镇静作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-4y2f8gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-4y2f8gg","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】微甘；微苦；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-ro24eoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-ro24eoy","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；脾；胃；肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-nunbzg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-nunbzg0","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热解毒；理气活血。主肺热咳嗽；肝炎；钩端螺旋体病；胸痛；胃痛；跌打损伤；毒蛇咬伤"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-75lv7f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-75lv7f9","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，9～15g；鲜品及治毒蛇咬伤用量加倍。外用：适量，煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-94lyy55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-94lyy55","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】①治肺热咳嗽：穿心草三钱，干红薯叶三钱。水煎服。(《广西中草药》)②治钩端螺旋体病：金猫头、岩泽兰、穿心草、岩松(均鲜草)各一钱半。水煎，分三次服。喉痛者加野花椒全株一两半；鼻出血者，用酢浆草捣烂冲服。外用榄茶树叶、香椿树叶、香椿树皮、臭茉莉叶、追山虎叶、酸汤秆全草各一斤煎汤，每天洗两次(《金展选编·传染病》)"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-4ph70fo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-4ph70fo","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-29cxpe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-29cxpe7","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《广西中草药》：理气，止痛，止咳。治肺热咳嗽，心胃气痛，毒蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-k4cvbbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-k4cvbbx","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《广西实用中草药新选》：凉肝胆，活血止痛。治黄痘，肝炎，胸痛，胃痛，跌打内伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-frddxpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-frddxpd","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.广州空军《常用中草药手册》：治急性支气管炎，肺炎，急性胃炎，十二指肠炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902143650-6wfioia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143650-6wfioia","updated":"20240902143659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902143651-l4bd2i9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902143651-l4bd2i9","updated":"20240902143659"}},{"ID":"20240902143652-ao8y28z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902143652-ao8y28z","updated":"20240902143659"}}]}